WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.397
Trees give us more than shade.
They give life room to thrive.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.180
They cool our streets, support wildlife, absorb carbon,
and help make the air around us cleaner.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.332
But as green spaces disappear, our neighbourhoods can become hotter,
and wildlife loses the places it needs.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.875
Every tree we plant with care, and every mature tree we protect,
can help build a greener, healthier place to live.

5
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.175
Because a greener Bangladesh begins
with the choices we make today.

6
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.767
GAACH. More trees. Brighter tomorrows.
